error[E0502]: `i32` does not implement `Tag`, which `name` requires of `T`
  --> mem:///main.lu:16:16
   |
13 | fn name[T: Tag](x: T) -> str { x.tag() }
   |            --- the bound is declared here
...
16 |     print(name(3))
   |                ^ this is `i32`
